  "title": "Maris-Tech Announces Receipt of Nasdaq Notification of Minimum Stockholders’ Equity Non-Compliance",
  "summary": "Rehovot, Israel, May 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Maris-Tech Ltd. (Nasdaq: MTEK, MTEKW) (“Maris-Tech” or the “Company”), a global leader in artificial intelligence (“AI”)-powered video intelligence technology, today announced that it has received a written notification (the “Notification Letter”) from the Listing Qualifications staff of The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (“Nasdaq”) notifying the Company that […] The post Maris-Tech Announces Receipt of Nasdaq Notification of Minimum Stockholders’ Equity Non-Compliance appeared first on MARIS - TECH .",
